<h2 id=3D"intuition">Intuition</h2>
<p>A brute force solution involves checking every possible triplet in the a=
rray to see if they sum to zero. This can be done using three nested loops,=
 iterating through each combination of three elements.</p>
<p>Duplicate triplets can be avoided by sorting each triplet, which ensures=
